      "commit": {
        "id": "599fb16c690defd1b61626644edf6d168692cad4",
        "message": "fix(dashboard): keep plan-picker loading geometry faithful (w4/m196)\n\nThe Instance Type picker's loading state was one ungrouped grid of six\nfixed 96px bars, so the card grew 196px (desktop) / 244px (mobile) when the\ncatalog settled into separate Free and Paid groups of 108px cards.\n\nThe ready picker and every plan-loading skeleton now share one group/card\nlayout (instance-type-groups.tsx): same group stack, heading, responsive\ngrid, card frame and text rows. The skeleton is shaped by service type via\nthe existing paid-only policy (offersFreeTier): web/cron reserve Free + Paid,\nworker/private reserve Paid only, and an undecided type never guesses Free.\nThe route pending frame reads the parent loader's type; the parent-pending\nand server-gate skeletons read it from the Apollo cache when present.\nSave stays disabled and no tier is selectable while loading."
      },
